STRING 2005
{
The kingdom of Lordaeron has fallen, brought low by its own Prince Arthas Menethil. But the Lich King’s grasp on the Scourge has weakened and a growing number of the undead led by Sylvanas Windrunner have broken free of their former master’s control. Calling themselves “the Forsaken,” they now seek to carve out their own place in a world that despises them.
 
Months after his fatal pursuit of vengeance, Garek Bandarion finds himself in the most unexpected of circumstances…
}

